'''Frostfire Essence''' is a material used to upgrade Nord weapons to their Frostfire variants. They are dropped by [[Fallen Warriors]] summoned by placing three [[Memorial Coal]] on the altar found at the [[Memorial Place]].

Frostfire weapons have a decreased amount of their main damage type, but gain [[Fire]] and [[Frost]] damage, combining to a greater amount of total damage than the base weapon.

